# Simulation outputs: only the per-scenario result CSVs are tracked. Everything else stays local: pedigrees (ped_*.csv, ped_cand_*.csv), COMA inputs (geno_*.csv.gz, k_*.csv.gz) and burnin images (*.Rdata).
outputs/** 
!outputs/.gitkeep 
!outputs/*/ 
!outputs/*/csv/
!outputs/*/csv/*.csv
